# LIFECYCLE RULES

Student academic history is permanent unless an explicit approved retention rule says otherwise.

Promotion:
- explicit authorized action;
- after academic year completion;
- never automatic without approval.

Section/branch/school transfer:
- preserve previous placement;
- create the new approved placement;
- never overwrite history.

One active academic placement at a time under the approved model.

Highest-class completion:
- no invented next class/section;
- do not create fake promotion rows.

Inactive does not mean historical deletion.
